    "extract": "Teatro Margherita is a former theatre in the city of Bari, Apulia on the east coast of Italy. Its predecessor, a wooden structure called Varietà Margherita opened on September 5, 1910. From 1912–1914, a new theatre was erected by architect Francesco De Giglio. It opened in 1914.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Teatro Margherita</b> is a former theatre in the city of Bari, Apulia on the east coast of Italy. Its predecessor, a wooden structure called <i>Varietà Margherita</i> opened on September 5, 1910. From 1912–1914, a new theatre was erected by architect Francesco De Giglio. It opened in 1914.</p>",
